-year) and PAT was INR75 crores (up 44% year-on-year). The company maintained a strong net cash position of INR471 crores and announced an interim dividend of INR5 per share, backed by broad-based growth across General Staffing, Professional Staffing, and Overseas segments. Quess Corp reported Q2 FY27 financial and operational results, highlighted by consolidated revenue of ₹ 4,396 Cr and PAT of ₹ 75 Cr. The company achieved a total headcount of 5,04,000, driven by net additions across its General Staffing, Professional Staffing, and Overseas business segments.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management expects 35,000 to 40,000 offers from The Brain channel in H2.","quote":"We expect 35,000 to 40,000 offers from this channel in H2.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets for AI to answer half of all queries by December and up to 80% by March 2027.","quote":"Our aim is for AI to answer half of all queries by December and up to 80% by March 2027 with a much faster resolution for our associates.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects the Professional Staffing exit margin for the year to be near 12% within a range of 11% to 12%.","quote":"Our exit still continues and our guidance for the year continues to be between 11% to 12% with an exit near 12% is where we want to be in PS, and we are working towards that.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The manufacturing vertical was highlighted as the fastest growing this quarter, adding 7,800 associates.","quote":"Our manufacturing vertical, in particular, was the fastest growing this time, adding 7,800 associates during the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Malaysian revenue grew 50% and Philippines grew 15% year-on-year.","quote":"Malaysian revenue grew 50%, Philippines grew 15% and together, overseas added 33 new contracts.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"The festive season is approaching and management sees demand from across the client base.","quote":"The festive season is coming up and we are seeing demand from across our client base, which gives us confidence heading into the seasonally strongest quarter, both by sourcing and sales.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"},{"claim":"India attracts between 250 and 300 Global Capability Centers (GCCs) every year.","quote":"India itself as a nation is attracting anywhere between 250 to 300 GCCs every year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Adjusted EBITDA for Q2 FY27 was INR92 crores, up 20% year-on-year with a margin of 2.1%.","quote":"Adjusted EBITDA, which excludes the noncash ESOP expense was INR92 crores, up 20% year-on-year with a margin of 2.1%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Professional Staffing gross margin percentage currently stands at 20.5% compared to 17.5% two years ago.","quote":"The gross margin in our PS business now stands at 20.5% against 17.5% 2 years ago.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Middle East operations delivered an EBITDA margin of 14.2% with flat revenues due to the geopolitical situation.","quote":"The Middle East delivered a margin of 14.2%, with flat revenues due to the geopolitical situation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Digital platform BCPL turned EBITDA positive in Q2 after a burn of nearly INR6 crores in the last financial year.","quote":"BCPL has turned EBITDA positive in Q2 after a burn of nearly INR6 crores in the last financial year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"General Staffing operating margin was 57 Cr, up 23% YoY.","quote":"General Staffing 57 ▲ 23% ▲ 11%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4a21eecc-7245-471f-a1f0-018133920ed2.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA for Q1 FY27 came in at Rs. 85 crores, representing a 21% year-on-year growth.","quote":"The EBITDA during this quarter came in at Rs. 85 crores. This is a 21% year-on-year growth with a margin at 2.02%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"},{"claim":"In Manufacturing, gross margin could be 5% or 6%.","quote":"If the normal trend of General Staffing PAPM is between the 600 to 700 at a broad level, in the Manufacturing space, the same could be anywhere between 800 to 1100. But from a gross margin perspective, in Consumer, it could be 2% to 3% gross margin, whereas in Manufacturing, it could be 5% or 6% gross margin.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"General Staffing added 116 new contracts during the quarter.","quote":"We added 116 new contracts and collections were the highest at INR 4,285 Cr, DSO improving to 24 days.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Professional Staffing signed 62 new contracts in H1.","quote":"We've signed a record 62 new contracts in H1, more than what we had signed in the entire fiscal year '26 and the quality of our mix keeps improving in IT staffing.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Total headcount reached 5,04,000 with a net addition of 21k in Q2.","quote":"Headcount of 5,04,000 – India’s largest staffing player with net addition of 21k in Q2","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4a21eecc-7245-471f-a1f0-018133920ed2.pdf"},{"claim":"The General Staffing business added 86 new contracts during the quarter.","quote":"We, however, added 86 new contracts during this quarter as well in our General Staffing business.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"},{"claim":"Professional Staffing added 36 new contracts with an open mandate of 1,100 positions.","quote":"We added 36 new contracts in our Professional Staffing platform during the quarter, with an open mandate of 1,100 positions, primarily in niche and high-value roles.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"},{"claim":"The overseas business added 37 new logos during the quarter.","quote":"We added 37 new logos during this quarter, with double-digit growth in both revenue as well as EBITDA.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company ended the quarter with a net cash position of INR471 crores after paying the final dividend for FY26.","quote":"Our balance sheet continues to remain strong with a net cash position of INR471 crores after paying the final dividend for the FY26 in the month of August.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"The Board approved an interim dividend of INR5 per share.","quote":"The Board has approved an interim dividend of INR5 per share.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Net operating cash flow for H1 was INR348 crores, including income tax refunds.","quote":"net operating cash flow for H1 was INR348 crores, including the income tax refunds.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf"},{"claim":"Net cash stood at ₹ 471 Cr after the final dividend of ~₹ 45 Cr of FY26 was paid in Q2.","quote":"Net cash of ₹ 471 Cr after final dividend of ~₹ 45 Cr of FY26 paid in Q2","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4a21eecc-7245-471f-a1f0-018133920ed2.pdf"},{"claim":"The company remains a zero-debt company as of June 2026.","quote":"Importantly, we remain a zero-debt company as of June 2026 with a healthy net cash position, reflecting the continued strength and discipline of our balance sheet.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"},{"claim":"The final dividend for the last financial year will be paid at Rs. 3 per share.","quote":"we will be paying a final dividend for the last financial year of Rs. 3 per share, staying true to our commitment of rewarding our shareholders at every step of the way.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Implementation of the new Labor Code resulted in a one-time revenue impact of Rs. 176 crores.","quote":"During the quarter, due to the implementation of the new Labor Code, resulted in a one-time revenue impact of Rs. 176 crores as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Phase 1 of Project Confluence will go live in January, with further phases coming up in 2027.","quote":"Phase 1 will go live in January, further phases coming up in 2027.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf","timeframe":"2027"},{"claim":"Work on the fractional workforce digital platform will continue until January 2027 when it goes completely live.","quote":"while the work on the digital platform will continue till January 2027 when it goes completely live.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf","timeframe":"January 2027"},{"claim":"Management aims to land its first solutions project in the second half of this year.","quote":"We aim to land our first solutions project in second half of this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d819b5b6-301a-421e-b869-76fc718ef974.pdf","timeframe":"H2"},{"claim":"Management aspires to have 20% to 25% revenues coming from higher margin businesses over the next three to four years.","quote":"Over the next three to four years, we aspire to have 20% to 25% revenues coming from higher margin businesses, changing the underlying composition of our company as well as the margin profile and trajectory.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ae6c13a3-e6b9-4f1f-892a-a519473cb48b.pdf","timeframe":"next 3 to 4 years"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":31,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":7,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}